<p>This is interesting. As with many concepts, the question here is &quot;what is the story?&quot;, you mention a nuclear meltdown and the spores becoming a big risk to a growing population. But what caused the meltdown? Who shipped it? You simply need to add some more meat to your concept as I do like it.</p>
<blockquote>
<p>The aggression towards others and possible self inflicted injury to one affected by the spores psychoactive capabilities</p>
</blockquote>
<p>I'll be honest, the aggression towards others isn't very interesting. I've read far too many SCP's with the whole forced aggression spiel. A stronger focus on the psychoactive properties may do your article good, as it's one of the most intriguing parts. If you respond to me please send a PM as I won't get a notification otherwise.</p>

